{"id":"8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-representable-presheaf.md","title":"Definition — Representable Presheaf","display":"Definition — Representable Presheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-representable-presheaf","aliases":["14-df-representable-presheaf"],"display":"Definition — Representable Presheaf","depends_on":["[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-representable-presheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-representable-presheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Representable Presheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (presheaf, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\">\\(\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})\\)</span> (Yoneda embedding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsNatural}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsNatural}\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> (object-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}\\)</span> (identity assignment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsRepresentable}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsRepresentable}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsRepresentable}(F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,F,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A))\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\beta,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A),F)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\beta_X\\circ\\alpha_X=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)}\\land\\alpha_X\\circ\\beta_X=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A)(X)})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsRepresentable}(F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\alpha,F,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A))\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\beta,\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A),F)\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\beta_X\\circ\\alpha_X=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)}\\land\\alpha_X\\circ\\beta_X=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}(A)(X)})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.1，印刷页 26–27。</p>\n<p>这里“可表示”针对反变集合值函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(A)\">\\(y(A)\\)</span> 的自然同构。表示对象的同构唯一性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cb7eec83c9952d6f\" href=\"?note=cb7eec83c9952d6f\" title=\"14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations\">14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations</a>；无须引用外部原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)$ (presheaf, see [[14-df-presheaf-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C})$ (Yoneda embedding, see [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsNatural}$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[14-df-natural-transformation]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob}$ (object-set operation, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{id}$ (identity assignment, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations","status":"resolved","id":"cb7eec83c9952d6f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里“可表示”针对反变集合值函子。$\\alpha,\\beta$ 给出与 $y(A)$ 的自然同构。表示对象的同构唯一性见 [[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations]]；无须引用外部原子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(\\mathbf y_{\\mathc